.TH CRYOLSP 1 "" "cryo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cryolsp \- language server for the Cryo programming language
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cryolsp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cryolsp
speaks the Language Server Protocol on its standard input and output, for
an editor to start and talk to.
It reports the diagnostics of the Cryo compiler it was built with, and
answers hover, go-to-definition and completion requests.
It takes no arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cryo (1)
